<p align="left"><b><font size="3">Baron Dlandridel Cadence - Epic Bard</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">July 31. 2002 - by
                          Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
 <font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
                          </b><p align="left">Congratulations Dlandridel on
Darkspheres first Bard Epic!!! You wanted it so bad, that you even made that
wuss of Trakanon flee like a coward!!! He knew what was coming, and he peed his
pants like another druid!!! WOOOT! Grats bro, its so well deserved!<p align="left">Many
thanks to the people who rushed to help Dlandridel and Darksphere in taking down
this beast! Darksphere will surely be there for you in your times off need!<p align="left">And
in your honor, it will be shown here for us to remember! (Tay took the pic, and
I apologize for the bad angle ;)


<p align="center"><img border="0" src="DlandridelEpic.jpg" width="373" height="529">


<p align="center">WOOT!<p align="left">and here you can see the coward Dragon
who ran from his own fooking lair!<p align="center"><a href="Kills/Trakanon01.jpg" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="Kills/Trakanon01small.jpg" width="512" height="384"></a><p align="left">The
coward bird also dropped a Cobalt Breastplate, that now rests on Vikos' chest, mismatching
his outfit even more! Tolaj decided to drop his uber haste robe, that Tonia now proudly
fashions! Grats to the both of you!! (Don't they make a lovely couple? :)<p align="center"><img border="0" src="VikosTonia.jpg" width="330" height="417"><p align="left">&nbsp;<p align="left">Well,
that's just about it! Once again, a huge grats to the bard, who is now dreaming
of blue notes! Grats!<p align="left">&nbsp;<p align="left">HA! think I would
sign off without the quotes!?&nbsp;<p align="left"><b>Quotes of the... day?:</b><p align="left">First
off I would like to say, you're NOT safe anywhere! I got lots of spies lurking
in the dark, taking screens whenever you fool around!<p align="left">Our tanks
are still on some spree, dunno what got to their heads...<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/25.jpg" width="294" height="12"><p align="left">Maybe
we should make Vikos a Gay O War to? Poll will follow on website.<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/26.jpg" width="221" height="14"><p align="left">Leezard
love... nuff said<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/27.jpg" width="478" height="15"><p align="left">Same
goes for dr00ds Tay ;)<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/28.jpg" width="578" height="33"><p align="left">...<p align="left">And
Vik, I swear to god, the next time you ask a bard about his songs, Im gonna kill
ya!<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/29.jpg" width="573" height="158"><p align="left">That's
it for tonight folks, catch ya later.
                          <p>&nbsp;


<p align="left"><b><font size="3">Back on track</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">July 30. 2002 - by
                          Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
 <font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
                          </b><p align="left">Yes! Tonight you showed us what
Darksphere really is all about! Fire? Ice? We came, we saw, we laid waste! Radir
even tried to pull some nasty tricks on us, like jumping us in the middle of a
fight, and having his lame guards warp all over. What's that all about? I'm
guessing the evil shade that have been following us for the last week is all
gone! Trakanon? That beast is gonna run and hide when we come knocking on his
door! - unless we send in Tay first that is... then he will just laugh... There
Vik, happy now? :D<p align="left">Anyways, big grats to tonight's winners! Duppo
on your Bracelet of Fortitude, Bragnar &quot;Gay O War&quot; Frostbane on your
new dirk toy, and to Picco for going Fabbas style and burning tons of dkps on a
new Necro rod and an uber Bracelet of Quickness! Grats all!<p align="left">As
promised I updated the links section with some links about the new weird
I-will-never-get-used-to-it User Interface. Haven't checked them out, so for all
I know, it could just be gay porn sites... Use at your own risk!! (Read <a href="Quotes/BragVikos01.jpg" target="_blank">this
disclaimer</a> before going there) - Be sure to read it!!!<p align="left">&nbsp;<p align="left"><b>Quotes,
you all love them:</b><p align="left">First off all - NO! I will NOT marry you!!<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/16.jpg" width="207" height="14"><p align="left">Our
tanks get scarier by the day!&nbsp;<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/17.jpg" width="242" height="14"><br>
<img border="0" src="Quotes/18.jpg" width="260" height="15"><br>
<img border="0" src="Quotes/19.jpg" width="360" height="16"><br>
<img border="0" src="Quotes/20.jpg" width="536" height="15"><br>
<img border="0" src="Quotes/21.jpg" width="435" height="13"><p align="left"><b>From
the Cadence mansion:</b><p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/22.jpg" width="571" height="40"><br>
Can anyone that speaks Russian send me a translation of this?<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/23.jpg" width="576" height="27"><br>
Senya tells Dlandridel: Joo got some explaining to do!!<p align="left">And this
weeks absolute winner! I'm guessing he is suicidal or something, and in respect
to our younger audience, I have chosen not to post my following discussion with
him...<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Quotes/24.jpg" width="285" height="13"><p align="center">W
T F !!!<p align="left">C you later all, be good!<p align="left">&nbsp;


<p align="left">&nbsp;


<p align="left"><b><font size="3">Just keep on rollin'</font><br>
                          </b><font size="1" color="#736459">July 27. 2002 - by
                          Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
                          </b><p align="left">Big update today. 3 new sections
                          online and fully operational. Charter is done, giving
                          a brief good description off what Darksphere is all
                          about, so be sure to let everyone who might be
                          interested in joining us, to take a look at this
                          page.&nbsp;<p align="left">Calendar section is up,
                          where you can see the current raid schedule for the
                          next week or more. It is of course subject to instant
                          changes, in case some ffa mob spawn, that we wanna
                          take down, so be sure to check it before you log on.
                          It is now possible to send Darksphere an application
                          form online, instead of contacting us in-game. I
                          suggest you do both, cause the more we know about you,
                          the better we know if you are suited for this fine
                          guild. Contacts section is up and running, so you know
                          where to send your emails. Any comments and ideas to
                          this page, can be mailed to the webmaster from that
                          same section.<p align="left">The roster is booming
                          with upgrades, so keep those links and key infos coming!
                          The faster we can get it complete the better. We are
                          working on posting in-game pictures of our members at
                          the roster as well, so don't be surprised if Katenia
                          or myself will ask you to pose for a quick picture in
                          the near future. Please do not send any pictures of
                          yourself, in-game or RL to us ;) Don't want my night
                          ruined cause of some ugly pic of a stoopid tank :D<p align="left">Pheew,
                          on with the kewl stuff!!&nbsp;<p align="left">Verant
                          decided to totally rape us tonight, by taking the
                          servers down during our good going PoF raid. Well
                          thank you VI, that was really nice of you. Slackers!!
                          Best thing was, that when they got back online, no GM
                          showed up to reset it for us, so I had to call the
                          raid. Hopefully we will have 10 times more luck in the
                          next few days.<p align="left"><b>Quotes:</b><p align="left">Darksphere
                          discussing epics...<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/10.jpg" width="523" height="14"><p align="left">and
                          here is the proof that Bacck spends waaaayy to much
                          time with bards...<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/11.jpg" width="288" height="14"><p align="left">Something
                          to think about...<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/12.jpg" width="340" height="15"><p align="left">Picco...
                          seek help<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/13.jpg" width="429" height="14"><p align="left">And
                          from our fave Gay o' War<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/14.jpg" width="574" height="27"><br>
                          <img border="0" src="Quotes/15.jpg" width="582" height="15"><p align="left">G'night
                          all, sleep well, I know I wont... ;)<p align="left">&nbsp;
                          <p align="left"><b><font size="3">Darksphere website!
                          Woot!</font><br>
                          </b><font size="1" color="#736459">July 23. 2002 - by
                          Njall</font><p align="left">That's right! Darksphere
                          got a brand new website! Along new leadership, new
                          rules and a blasting cool new loot system, we are
                          proud to present you with this new website! This site
                          will feature anything from current dkp standings, our
                          fully updated roster, rules, link to our boards, rants
                          and chants, Vikos' dating page, quotes of the week and
                          much much more! Currently some of the sections are
                          under construction, but they will be up and running
                          soon! Also, in order to keep our roster fully updated,
                          I would like you all to reply to my post on the forum,
                          so we can assemble the info we need.<p align="left">A new website, deserves
                          some new killshots. I'm sure most of you still live
                          high on that little showdown we had with Esorpa the
                          other day! So here she is! One dead Dragon!<p align="center"><a href="Kills/Esorpabig.jpg" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="Kills/Esorpasmall.png" width="368" height="314"></a><p align="left">What
                          a blast we had taking this bitch down! Loot wasn't
                          something to cry out of, but we nailed her, finally
                          taking our revenge from the countless times she jumped
                          and wiped us! Grats Yizz on your 6/5 talisman and
                          Tonia on the second page of that chanter quest thingy!<p align="left">The
                          page will be updated on a regular base, if not every
                          day, at least a few times a week, so expect to see a
                          lot of action around here!<p align="left"><b>Quotes of
                          the week!</b><p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/01.jpg" width="482" height="15"><p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/02.jpg" width="517" height="27"><p align="left">From
                          the Cadence mansion:<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/03.jpg" width="406" height="14"><br>
                          <img border="0" src="Quotes/04.jpg" width="273" height="14"><br>
                          <img border="0" src="Quotes/05.jpg" width="542" height="28"><p align="left">This
                          guild have so much love...<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/06.jpg" width="167" height="15"><br>
                          <img border="0" src="Quotes/07.jpg" width="167" height="14"><br>
                          <img border="0" src="Quotes/08.jpg" width="154" height="14"><br>
                          <img border="0" src="Quotes/09.jpg" width="185" height="15"><p align="left">That's
                          about what I could find in my old screenshots, but
                          believe me, I'm gonna be more ready on that trigger in
                          the future!! Stay tuned for more! Now let's keel some
                          dragons!
